# SEQUENCE  Peace  (Thrmnlra)  every missile recalled, the bombers home, the command stood
# down, all before the launch codes on the Big Board filled up (fewer than 8 typos).
# Reached when Map.seq ends (the card's Seq.Ended). Then back to GREETINGS.
when      | track | clip    | settings                                                         | what
0         | world | Cue     | call=Thrm.Clock; mode=time                                       |
+0.4      | term  | Type    | text=NOBODY WILL EVER KNOW WHAT YOU ALMOST DID.; cps=24; color=#C8C8C8 | the machine, quietly
+1.2      | world | Cue     | call=Thrm.World; mood=off                                        | the map goes dark
with      | term  | Fade    | dur=0.4; clear=yes                                               |
+0.5      | term  | Console | x=0.35; y=0.45; w=0.6; rows=3; size=16; clear=yes                 |
+0        | term  | Type    | text=STRANGE GAME.; cps=6; cursor=yes; linger=2.5                 | the computer types it
+0        | term  | Fade    | dur=1.2; clear=yes                                               | fade to black, and GREETINGS again
